{"id": "16-1225-2-2", "zh": "以 ra 结尾的词根", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1226-2-5", "zh": "rā，义为“取”。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1226-6-7", "zh": "rāti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1227-2-4", "zh": "ri，义为“相续”。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1227-5-6", "zh": "reti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1227-7-8", "zh": "reṇu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1227-9-12", "zh": "reṇu 就是尘埃。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1228-2-6", "zh": "ru，义为“行走”与“发怒”。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1228-7-10", "zh": "ravati、viravati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1229-2-4", "zh": "ru，义为“发声”。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1229-5-8", "zh": "roti、ravati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1229-9-12", "zh": "ravo、uparavo。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1229-13-17", "zh": "叫声悦耳，背部也美观。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "16-1229-18-24", "zh": "ruta 就是鸣叫，也就是声音。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1230-2-4", "zh": "re，义为“发声”。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1230-5-6", "zh": "rāyati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1230-7-8", "zh": "rā。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1230-9-10", "zh": "ratti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1230-11-16", "zh": "这里的 **rā** 是指声音。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1230-17-23", "zh": "**ratti** 是指被称为夜晚的、众生声音平息的时候。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1230-24-29", "zh": "声音在这个时候被切断、止息，所以叫做 ratti（夜晚）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1231-2-5", "zh": "brū，义为“清楚地说话”。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1231-6-10", "zh": "即使打了别人，也说自己被打。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "16-1232-2-5", "zh": "bravīti、brunti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1232-6-9", "zh": "brūsi、brūtha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1232-10-13", "zh": "brūmi、brūma。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1232-14-17", "zh": "brūte、bruvante。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1232-18-21", "zh": "brūse、bruvhe。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1232-22-25", "zh": "bruve、brumhe。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1233-2-7", "zh": "brūtu、bruvitu、bruvantu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1233-8-11", "zh": "brūhi、brūtha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1233-12-15", "zh": "brūmi、brūma。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1233-16-19", "zh": "brūtaṃ、bruvantaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1234-2-22", "zh": "这里，因为在《阿摩昼经》中见到“请尊者乔达摩再说一遍”（puna bhavaṃ gotamo bruvitu）这句经文，所以列出了“bruvitu”。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1234-23-28", "zh": "在其他各处也都应当这样仔细考察，把握其中的规律。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1235-2-7", "zh": "bruveyya、bruve、bruveyyuṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1235-8-11", "zh": "bruveyyāsi、bruveyyātha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1235-12-15", "zh": "bruveyyāmi、bruveyyāma。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1235-16-19", "zh": "bruvetha、bruveraṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1235-20-23", "zh": "bruvetho、bruveyyāvho。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1235-24-25", "zh": "bruveyyaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1235-26-27", "zh": "bruveyyāmhe。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1236-2-3", "zh": "pabrūti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1236-4-5", "zh": "anubrūti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1236-6-9", "zh": "pabrūtu、anubrūtu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1236-10-13", "zh": "pabruveyya、anubruveyya。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1236-14-21", "zh": "同样，在各处也应当视情况加上前缀 pa、anu，排出词形表。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1237-2-5", "zh": "āha、āhu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1237-6-11", "zh": "brave、bravittha、bravire。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1237-12-15", "zh": "bravittho、bravivho。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1237-16-19", "zh": "braviṃ、bravimhe。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1237-20-22", "zh": "以上是按远过去时（parokkhā）列出的。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1238-2-6", "zh": "abravā、abravū。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1238-7-10", "zh": "abravo、abravattha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1238-11-14", "zh": "abravaṃ、abravamhā。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1238-15-18", "zh": "abravattha、abravatthuṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1238-19-22", "zh": "abravase、abravhaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1238-23-26", "zh": "abraviṃ、abravimhase。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1238-27-29", "zh": "以上是按昨日过去时（hiyyattanī）列出的。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1239-2-5", "zh": "abravi、abravuṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1239-6-9", "zh": "abravo、abravittha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1239-10-13", "zh": "abraviṃ、abravimhā。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1239-14-17", "zh": "abravā、abravū。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1239-18-21", "zh": "abravase、abravivhaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1239-22-25", "zh": "abravaṃ、abravimhe。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1239-26-28", "zh": "以上是按今日过去时（ajjatanī）列出的。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1240-2-5", "zh": "bruvissati、bruvissanti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1240-6-9", "zh": "abravissā、abravissaṃsu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1240-10-13", "zh": "其余的都应依此类推。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1240-14-16", "zh": "被动语态的词形很少见。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1240-17-38", "zh": "如果有的话，应当是“brūyati”，就像“luyati、lūyati”这些词一样。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1241-2-4", "zh": "jīra，义为“增长”。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1241-5-7", "zh": "brūhana 就是增长。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1241-8-9", "zh": "jīrati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1241-10-11", "zh": "jīraṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1241-12-13", "zh": "jīramāno。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1241-14-15", "zh": "jīraṇaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1241-16-21", "zh": "这个少闻的人，就像公牛一样只是长大而已。", "confidence": 75}
